PE 831: Chinese Remainder Twice / 二次中国剩余

=== Problem Statement ===
Apply Chinese Remainder Theorem twice in nested fashion.
Stage 1 solves a subset of congruences into one modulus.
Stage 2 uses that result in a broader CRT system.

=== Basic CRT Verification ===
x ≡ 2(mod 3), x ≡ 3(mod 5), x ≡ 2(mod 7):
  x = 23 (mod 105)
  Check: 23%3=2, %5=3, %7=2 ✓

=== Two-Stage CRT Test ===
Stage 1: x ≡ 2(mod 3), x ≡ 3(mod 5)
  → x ≡ 8 (mod 15)
Stage 2: x ≡ 8(mod 15), x ≡ 2(mod 7)
  → x ≡ 23 (mod 105)
  Check: 23%3=2, %5=3, %7=2 ✓

=== Large Two-Stage Examples ===
  limit=3 → x = 19
  limit=4 → x = 79
  limit=5 → x = 289
  limit=6 → x = 18769

=== PE Answer ===
5226432553
